\f0\fs24 \cf0 Hole - 11/11/89 at Huntington Beach or 10-24-89 at Nightmoves\
\
This show shows Hole at a very early stage in their career. Later Courtney would call this version a "false Hole" and it's not hard to see why. The most interesting things about this stage in their development was the fact that there was a third guitarist and that various members, mostly Lisa Roberts (no relation to Julia Roberts) would sing backup, something that didn't appear again until the band went for a more pop approach for their second album, although their approach is more in the punk/gang vocals area. The third guitarist (Errol Stuart or Stewart) adds some interesting sounds, most noticeably in "Retard Girl".\
